<title>SWITZERLAND: Baloise says on way to reaching target.</title>
<headline>Baloise says on way to reaching target.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss insurer Baloise Holding Group said a 19 percent rise in 1996 profit further consolidated its strong position and it was well on the way to achieving its target of a profit of around 240 million Swiss francs in 1998.</p>
<p>Baloise's 1996 group profit rose to 191 million francs from 1995's 161 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The Baloise Insurance Group is thus well on the way to achieving its stated goal of doubling group profit to approximately 240 million Swiss francs between 1993 and 1998,&quot; Baloise said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
